{"code": 1, "data": {"content": "<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\">[收录于&nbsp; <strong><em><a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"/news/2396/content00795?type=0\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">#链产品&nbsp;</span></a></em></strong> 合集]</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\">作为实现人人互连、人物互连、万物互连的基础方式，物流是5G和物联网技术应用的最佳场景。在打好5G网络根基的同时，京东物流也在全力推进5G技术落地应用，将积累的5G与智能物流的技术经验开放共享，LoMir智能物流园区管理平台就是其中之一。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px; background-color: #ef7312;\">&nbsp;Q:&nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: #ffffff;\"> &nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\">如何实现物流园区全方位智能管控？</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\">应用京东物流LoMir智能物流园区管理平台。</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; color: #c91623;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">智能物流园区管理平台</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/133699/30/30636/230197/6321a16eEd4c3ebcd/5e8a9b644c831c49.png\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/120120/16/28808/560316/6321a187E2dec77a3/37cfbde511d3c401.gif\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">LoMir（Logistics Mirror,译作络明）</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">即物流镜像，意在通过数字孪生技术建立物流物理世界的数字镜像。</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\">LoMir是京东物流基于5G、物联网、人工智能、区块链等关键技术打造的高智能、自决策、一体化的智能物流园区平台，致力于利用数字化技术提升园区内交接和流转效率，给政府和企业客户创造价值。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\">LoMir期望通过数字镜像的模拟、仿真和反馈，带来物理世界的效率革命，从而构建一个连接无处不在、智能无所不能的智能物流世界。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #c91623; font-size: 20px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">LoMir的应用场景</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/50153/23/16786/598356/6321a1d5E992e5fbb/9b0a3c3e676c90c9.gif\" /></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">● 企业生产型物流园区场景的痛点</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">发货效率低，包括提货车辆到场时间不可控、备货区容易积压、司机串点提货调度困难等；履约时效管理难，缺乏货物在途监控管理手段；管理者缺乏全链路运营监控可视化工具。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">● 城市物流枢纽场景的痛点</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">城市缺乏物流顶层设计，公路、铁路、民航等公共信息资源未能有效整合，无法实现城市物流统一管控；城市物流共享率和作业效率低，城市终端物流配送成本偏高，不利于整体发展；城市物流枢纽、园区、仓库等物流节点设备老旧、自动化水平低、分布不合理；物流信息化与数智化水平低下，线下执行现象普遍。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #c91623; font-size: 20px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">LoMir的功能介绍</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">数字场站</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">Digital Yard System</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">园区车辆调度更高效</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">面向各类物流园区提供车辆出入与调度的软硬件一体化产品，优化预约计划，实现有序现场管理，缩短车辆排队时长、提高车辆调度效率。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/222048/23/19194/23938/6321a237E727b62a1/d3f9462aa0f15c79.png\" /></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">数字车队</span></strong><br /><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">Digital Fleet System</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">运营管控更智能</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">面向各类运输场景，为货主和承运商提供货车与货物定位、司机安全的软硬件一体化产品，实现在途全程可视和可控，保障运输时效和安全。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/51582/12/21554/289480/6321a259E34325cab/105dea492be625a5.png\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">链上签 ePOD</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">交接无纸化和运营智能化</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">面向企业物流提供电子签约和区块链存证服务，实现单据无纸交接和自动对账，提升物流运营效率，降低物流运营成本。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/150720/37/24551/238140/6321a27cEe3c51d08/ba09a440ef3ab1f0.png\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">京源链&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">JD Tracing Chain</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">商品全流程立体追溯</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">面向政府和企业提供商品生产端到消费端的全流程追溯服务，确保生产过程可管控、流通过程可追踪、商品品质可信赖，实现安全监管保障和地方品牌保障。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/110445/9/31756/43063/6321a2a2Ee6e15fe2/42b6b23092c67dec.png\" /></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">智能物业</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">Smart Property Management</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">商品全流程立体追溯</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">基于物联网、人工智能等技术，为园区周界、内部道路、大厅、走廊、室内等公共区域提供环境感知、能源管控、人车通行、视频巡更等数字化管理解决方案。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/46181/22/21679/105949/6321a2c8E30e5ba91/54e306957533b15a.png\" /></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">视能方 Vision Cube</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">视觉感知与智能化分析</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">基于视频联网和计算机视觉技术为企业构建全方位视觉感知网络，实现生产、运营和安防异常事件的智能识别与主动预警，助力企业实现自动化运营和自主化安防。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/200011/21/27950/302490/6321a2e9Ee39a8294/f8c46216f8da2fee.png\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">RFID标签和企业套件</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">RFID Tag and Enterprise Suite</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">助力企业数字化转型</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">面向家电、家居、快消、服装、酒水等行业设计的专用RFID标签，采用性能出色的Inlay、高性价比的封装和复合技术，配合企业套件定制RFID解决方案，实现货物、载具、设备全连接，帮助企业实现物流资产和作业过程的数字化，提升供应链物流效率。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/130167/12/24887/214611/6321a30fEb54b4734/da4a93f57a4a4b6d.png\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">据统计，在应用 LoMir智能物流平台的物流园区，异常情况发生率降低 50%，安防成本下降 15%，人员效率提升 15%，园区整体运营成本降低 10%左右，园区场地中转效率可提升 10%～15%。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">了解更多</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">LoMir产品信息</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">欢迎官方电话<span style=\"color: #c91623;\">950616</span>或</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: #c91623;\">官网留言</span>咨询</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://getwuce.jdl.com/#/diyForm?formCode=BD3187402377390195328&amp;channelL1Code=l1-ch8&amp;channelCode=wucech87219\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/218765/28/21852/43354/6322ef45E15ce7679/cf772424d8219e4a.png\" /></a></p>", "contentAbstract": "", "contentCode": "content00812", "contentTitle": "如何实现物流园区全方位智能管控？", "contentType": 2, "createTime": 1663148257000, "id": 2418, "isDelete": 0, "link": "", "linkType": 0, "projectName": "京东物流官网", "srcUrl": "/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/96411/4/30537/17229/6321a425E7cfe9d1e/c326d50a2ff46d63.png", "updateTime": 1677147880000}}